gin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><span style=3D"color:#000000;white-spac=
e:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;fon=
t-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Bitcoin Industry Participants</span>=
</p>
