 Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.  Service providers offer=
 a multitude of services to other participants in the Bitcoin industry, inc=
luding custodial and trade execution services, commercial and retail paymen=
t processing, loans secured by bitcoin collateral, and financial advisory s=
ervices.  If adoption of the Bitcoin network continues to materially increa=
se, we anticipate that service providers may expand the currently available=
 range of services and that additional parties will enter the service secto=
r for the Bitcoin network.</span><span style=3D"color:#000000;white-space:p=
