mers in January 2022, and governments including the United States and the E=
uropean Union have discussed the potential creation of new CBDCs. For a dis=
cussion of risks relating to the emergence of other digital assets, see =93=
Item 1A. Risk Factors =96 Risks Related to Our Bitcoin Strategy and Holding=
