h imposes requirements regarding the handling and security of personal data=
, requires disclosure of data breaches to individuals, customers, and data =
protection authorities in certain circumstances, requires companies to hono=
r data subjects=92 requests relating to their personal data, permits regula=
tors to impose fines of up to =8020,000,000 or 4% of global annual revenue,=
 whichever is higher, and establishes a private right of action.</span></p>
