ied a cumulative-effect adjustment to the opening balance of retained earni=
ngs as of January 1, 2025 of $12.745 billion. ASU 2023-08 does not permit r=
etrospective restatement of prior periods. Accordingly, we expect the adopt=
ion of ASU 2023-08 to significantly affect the carrying value of our bitcoi=
n on our balance sheet.</span></p>
