s has been negatively impacted by our continued transition of customers to =
subscription services offerings, which have resulted in (i) reduced cash co=
llections due to lower revenues and invoicing over multiple years, (ii) inc=
reased costs of our cloud infrastructure to support increased usage, and (i=
ii) increased commissions paid to our sales team to incentivize cloud migra=
