included in the financial statements. Under this method, the Company determ=
ines deferred tax assets and deferred tax liabilities on the basis of diffe=
rences between the financial statement and tax bases of assets and liabilit=
ies by using enacted tax rates in effect for the year in which differences =
are expected to reverse. The effect of a change in the tax rates on deferre=
d tax assets and deferred tax liabilities is recognized in income in the pe=
riod that includes the enactment date.</span><span style=3D"color:#000000;w=
