rting period. ASU 2023-08 also requires certain interim and annual disclosu=
res for crypto assets within the scope of the standard. The Company will ad=
opt this guidance effective January 1, 2025 on a prospective basis, with a =
cumulative-effect adjustment to the opening balance of retained earnings. P=
rior periods will not be restated. The Company is in the process of impleme=
nting changes to internal controls over financial reporting to allow the Co=
mpany to timely compile the information needed to account for crypto assets=
